	<ouc:div label="main-content" group="Everyone" button-text="Main Content"><ouc:editor csspath="/_resources/ou/editor/wysiwyg.css" cssmenu="/_resources/ou/editor/styles.txt" wysiwyg-class="main-content"/><!-- Registration Announcement -->
<div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 20px;">
<div style="background-color: #003043; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; color: #ffffff; max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto;">
<h2 style="margin: 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold;">🚀 Start Your Next Chapter!</h2>
<p style="margin: 10px 0 20px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5;">Summer &amp; Fall registration will open May 18, 2026. Secure your spot today and plan for success in 2026. <strong>Enrollment Services</strong> and <strong>Counseling</strong> are available to help you every step of the way.</p>
<a style="display: inline-block; background-color: #00a3e0; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 5px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;" title="Learn more about registering at LTCC" href="{{f:72314356}}"> Register Now </a></div>
</div>
<!-- SUMMER / FALL -->
<div style="text-align: center; max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto;"><strong style="font-size: 24px;">Summer/Fall 2026 Class Schedule</strong>
<p style="font-size: 18px;"><strong>Summer Quarter:</strong> July 6, 2026 - August 14, 2026</p>
<p style="font-size: 18px;"><strong>Fall Quarter:</strong> September 14, 2026 - December 10, 2026</p>
<p style="font-size: 18px;">Download the Summer/Fall 2026 Schedule (<a title="PDF of schedule" href="{{f:84646259}}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">PDF</a>) &rarr;</p>
<p style="font-size: 18px;"><strong>Fall 2026 Final Exam Schedule</strong> (<a href="{{f:80875986}}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">PDF</a>) &rarr;</p>
<p style="font-size: 18px;"><a href="https://www.ltcc.edu/about/institutional-effectiveness/schedulechangesdashboard.php"> View Changes to Schedule </a></p>
</div>
<!-- Summer/Fall Flipbook -->
<div style="aspect-ratio: 16 / 9; width: 100%; max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto 40px; overflow: hidden;"><iframe style="width: 100%; height: 100%; border: none;" title="Summer/Fall 2026 class schedule flipbook" src="https://online.fliphtml5.com/uqnlo/sumfall825/" allowfullscreen="allowfullscreen" loading="lazy">
  </iframe></div>
<!-- SPRING -->
<div style="text-align: center; max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto;"><strong style="font-size: 24px;">Spring 2026 Class Schedule</strong>
<p style="font-size: 18px;"><strong>Spring Quarter:</strong> April 6, 2026 - June 25, 2026</p>
<p style="font-size: 18px;">Download the Spring 2026 Schedule (<a title="Spring26" href="{{f:81874163}}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">PDF</a>) &rarr;</p>
<p style="font-size: 18px;"><strong>Spring 2026 Final Exam Schedule</strong> (<a href="{{f:77896391}}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">PDF</a>) &rarr;</p>
<p style="font-size: 18px;"><a href="https://www.ltcc.edu/about/institutional-effectiveness/schedulechangesdashboard.php"> View Changes to Schedule </a></p>
</div>
<!-- Spring Flipbook -->
<div style="aspect-ratio: 16 / 9; width: 100%; max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto 40px; overflow: hidden;"><iframe style="width: 100%; height: 100%; border: none;" title="Spring 2026 class schedule flipbook" src="https://online.fliphtml5.com/uqnlo/spring26-Krg3/" allowfullscreen="allowfullscreen" loading="lazy">
  </iframe></div>
<!-- NOTES -->
<p style="font-size: 18px; text-align: center; max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto;"><strong>Please Note:</strong> LTCC is updating course numbers as part of the new statewide <strong>Common Course Numbering (CCN)</strong> system. Look for the new codes in the schedule, marked with a "C", to help ensure smooth transfer and degree progress. <a href="{{f:72146407}}">Learn more today.</a></p>
<!-- ACTION LINKS -->
<p style="font-size: 18px; text-align: center;"><strong> <a id="apply-now-link-schedule" href="https://www.opencccapply.net/gateway/apply?cccMisCode=221" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Apply to LTCC</a> | <a href="https://ss.ltcc.edu:8183/Student/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Register for Classes</a> | <a href="https://ss.ltcc.edu:8183/Student/Courses/Search" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Find Classes</a> | <a href="https://ltcc.ecampus.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Find Textbooks</a> </strong></p>
<!-- STUDENT NOTICE -->
<p><strong>STUDENTS:</strong> Please be aware that your courses may be held virtually in limited circumstances. If that occurs, the College will notify you via <a href="https://www.ltcc.edu/campusresources/health-and-safety/alert-notification-system.php">LTCC Alert</a>. <strong>Please sign up for LTCC Alert.</strong></p>
